{"ID":"20230925154429-64nnvaj","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20230925154429-64nnvaj","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230925154429-64nnvaj\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230925154436-1oxgfnc\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230925154436-183fpnu\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230925154436-183fpnu\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:34,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:34\u0026#125;","title":"【防己地黄汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20230925154436"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230925154436-1oxgfnc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925154436-1oxgfnc","updated":"20230925154436"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"组成：防己一钱、桂枝三钱、防风三钱、甘草二钱"}]},{"ID":"20230925154436-jv0c3gs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925154436-jv0c3gs","updated":"20230925154436"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"右四味，以酒一杯，浸之一宿，绞取汁，生地黄二斤，口父咀，蒸之如斗米饭久，以铜器盛其汁，更绞地黄汁，和分再服。"}]},{"ID":"20230925154436-183fpnu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230925154436-183fpnu","updated":"20230925154436"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《金匮要略》防己地黄汤：治病如狂状，妄行，独语不休，天寒热，其脉浮。"}]}]}